# pdf-service has no required environment variables.
#
# This package is a reference implementation; the canonical, integrated
# copy used by the running stack is backend/src/services/pdf/, which
# inherits its configuration (S3_*, etc.) from backend/.env.
#
# To run this package's standalone test/sample generator:
#   npm install
#   node tests/test.js
#   node src/index.js   # generates a sample PDF to output/
